Cloud computing provides measurable business value beyond technical improvements. Organisations benefit from increased agility, reduced infrastructure investment, improved scalability, stronger business continuity, and faster innovation.

Business benefits include:

* Reduced capital expenditure
* Faster service delivery
* Global reach
* Improved resilience
* Enhanced collaboration
* Better resource utilisation

# Real-Life Example:
For example, a startup can launch applications globally without purchasing physical servers or building datacentres.

# Real-Life Use Case:
A real-life use case is enterprises accelerating digital transformation while reducing operational overhead.

Understanding business value helps organisations justify cloud investments and align technology decisions with strategic goals.
